This is the simplest lab of path traversal to make you understand of how does path traversal vulnerability can be exploited.

In this lab, it is told that vulnerability is in the display of product image.
- Open any article.
- open the image of that article in new tab.
- Now launch the burp suite, and now in the "filename" paramter add "../../../etc/passwd", as asked in question.
- Capture this request and send to repeater.
- Now in repeater send this enter and in response you will get the content present at "/etc/passwd"
- your lab completed.
